; --- Perils of the Warp (X2Ability_Astartes_Librarian) ---
[Astartes_PerilsOfTheWarp X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Perils of the Warp"
LocLongDescription="Every psychic power risks the Perils of the Warp once it has resolved. Minor powers are safest; the great workings of the Codicier and Epistolary are not. A better Psychic Hood lowers the risk. The Warp may surge in the Librarian's favour, lash back through his body, stun him, strip his powers for a time, or, rarely, drag him screaming into the Immaterium."
LocHelpText="Psychic powers may backfire. A better Psychic Hood lowers the risk."
LocFlyOverText="Perils of the Warp"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Every psychic power rolls for Perils after it resolves.<br/><Bullet/> Warp Charge 1 powers: 8%. Charge 2: 14%. Charge 3: 20%. Mk II hood -3%, relic hood -6%.<br/><Bullet/> Outcomes: Warp Surge (free action), Psychic Backlash (armour-ignoring damage), Warp Shock (stun), Mental Purge (all powers on cooldown), Dragged into the Warp (a daemon takes him; he is lost).<br/>"

[Astartes_Perils_WarpSurge X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Warp Surge"
LocLongDescription="The Warp answers generously. The Librarian regains an action."
LocHelpText="Perils outcome: the Librarian regains an action."
LocFlyOverText="Warp Surge"

[Astartes_Perils_Backlash X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Psychic Backlash"
LocLongDescription="Warp energy earths itself through the Librarian's body. Damage that ignores armour."
LocHelpText="Perils outcome: damage that ignores armour."
LocFlyOverText="Psychic Backlash"

[Astartes_Perils_WarpShock X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Warp Shock"
LocLongDescription="The Librarian's mind reels from the Immaterium's touch. Stunned."
LocHelpText="Perils outcome: stunned."
LocFlyOverText="Warp Shock"

[Astartes_Perils_MentalPurge X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Mental Purge"
LocLongDescription="The Librarian's powers slip from his grasp. Every psychic power goes on cooldown."
LocHelpText="Perils outcome: every psychic power on cooldown."
LocFlyOverText="Mental Purge"

[Astartes_Perils_Possession X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Dragged into the Warp"
LocLongDescription="A daemon claims the Librarian's soul and bursts from his body onto the battlefield. The brother is lost, and his geneseed with him."
LocHelpText="Perils outcome: the Librarian is lost and a daemon takes the field."
LocFlyOverText="Dragged into the Warp"

; --- Assault Marine jump pack: the vanilla IcarusJump, retuned in place and renamed here ---
[IcarusJump X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Jump Pack"
LocLongDescription="Fire the jump pack and land anywhere within 14 tiles, over walls, rooftops and enemies alike. Costs one action and does not end the turn: jump, then strike. 2-turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Jump to any tile within 14 tiles, ignoring terrain. One action, does not end the turn. 2-turn cooldown."
LocFlyOverText="Jump Pack"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Jump to any visible tile within 14 tiles, ignoring terrain and height.<br/><Bullet/> Costs one action and does not end the turn, so you can jump and then attack.<br/><Bullet/> 2-turn cooldown.<br/>"

; --- Assault Marine, round-out (X2Ability_Astartes_Assault) ---
[Astartes_Charge X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Charge"
LocLongDescription="A chainsword swung at the end of a charge bites deeper. After moving this turn, melee attacks gain +25 critical chance and +1 damage."
LocHelpText="After moving this turn, melee gains +25 crit and +1 damage."
LocFlyOverText="Charge"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Melee attacks made after moving this turn gain +25 critical chance and +1 damage.<br/>"

[Astartes_ShockLanding X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Shock Landing"
LocLongDescription="The jump pack's landing concusses everything around the impact point. Enemies adjacent to where the Marine lands from a jump are disoriented."
LocHelpText="Enemies adjacent to a jump landing are disoriented."
LocFlyOverText="Shock Landing"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Landing from the Jump Pack or Deep Jump disorients adjacent enemies.<br/>"

[Astartes_HitAndRun X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Hit and Run"
LocLongDescription="Strike, then leave. A melee kill clears the jump pack's cooldown, so a Marine who kept an action can jump straight back out."
LocHelpText="Melee kills reset the jump pack cooldown."
LocFlyOverText="Hit and Run"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> A melee kill resets the cooldown of Jump Pack and Deep Jump.<br/>"

[Astartes_HammerOfWrath X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Hammer of Wrath"
LocLongDescription="Come down on them. On the turn the Marine lands from a jump, his melee attacks deal +3 damage and shred 2 armour."
LocHelpText="After a jump landing, melee this turn deals +3 damage and shreds 2 armour."
LocFlyOverText="Hammer of Wrath"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> On the turn you land from a jump, melee attacks deal +3 damage and shred 2 armour.<br/>"

[Astartes_DeepJump X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Deep Jump"
LocLongDescription="The long jump. Land anywhere within 28 tiles. One action, does not end the turn. 3-turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Jump to any tile within 28 tiles. One action, does not end the turn. 3-turn cooldown."
LocFlyOverText="Deep Jump"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> A second jump with twice the range: any visible tile within 28 tiles.<br/><Bullet/> One action, does not end the turn. 3-turn cooldown.<br/>"

[Astartes_AngelOfDeath X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Angel of Death"
LocLongDescription="Once per mission the Marine becomes the storm: regain 2 actions, the jump pack is ready again, and +4 mobility for the rest of the turn."
LocHelpText="Once per mission: regain 2 actions, jump pack cooldown cleared, +4 mobility this turn."
LocFlyOverText="Angel of Death"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Free action, once per mission.<br/><Bullet/> Regain 2 actions and clear the jump pack cooldown.<br/><Bullet/> +4 mobility for the rest of the turn.<br/>"

[Astartes_DeathFromAboveBlade X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Death from Above"
LocLongDescription="Once per mission, for the rest of this turn the jump pack costs no action and the chainsword cannot miss."
LocHelpText="Once per mission: this turn the jump pack is free and melee cannot miss."
LocFlyOverText="Death from Above"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Free action, once per mission.<br/><Bullet/> For the rest of the turn, Jump Pack and Deep Jump cost no action.<br/><Bullet/> Melee attacks this turn cannot miss.<br/>"

[Astartes_HoldFast X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Hold Fast"
LocLongDescription="Braced in power armour, the Marine is far harder to bring down up close. Melee attacks against him lose 25 to-hit."
LocHelpText="Melee attacks against the Marine lose 25 to-hit."
LocFlyOverText="Hold Fast"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Enemy melee attacks against this Marine suffer -25 to hit.<br/>"

; --- Tactical, Devastator, Apothecary, Librarian round-out ---
[Astartes_TacticalDoctrine X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Tactical Doctrine"
LocLongDescription="The sergeant's drill keeps the whole squad moving. Every Marine on the mission gains +1 mobility."
LocHelpText="Squad: +1 mobility."
LocFlyOverText="Tactical Doctrine"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Every Marine on the mission gains +1 mobility while the sergeant is on it.<br/>"

[Astartes_HoldTheLine X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Hold the Line"
LocLongDescription="The squad holds its ground. Every Marine in full cover is 10 harder to hit."
LocHelpText="Squad: +10 defence while in full cover."
LocFlyOverText="Hold the Line"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Every Marine on the mission gains +10 defence while in full cover.<br/>"

[Astartes_ChapterBanner X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Chapter Banner"
LocLongDescription="The standard of the Chapter steels every brother. The squad gains +20 Will, and while the banner-bearer stands the Librarian's Perils of the Warp chance is lowered."
LocHelpText="Squad: +20 Will. Lowers the Librarian's Perils chance."
LocFlyOverText="Chapter Banner"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Every Marine on the mission gains +20 Will.<br/><Bullet/> While the banner-bearer lives, Librarians roll Perils of the Warp 4% less often.<br/>"

[Astartes_CombatSquads X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Combat Squads"
LocLongDescription="Split the squad. The sergeant and one chosen brother each gain a free move. Once per mission."
LocHelpText="You and one brother gain a free move. Once per mission."
LocFlyOverText="Combat Squads"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Free action, once per mission.<br/><Bullet/> Target a brother: he and the sergeant each gain a move action.<br/>"

[Faceoff X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Codex Volley"
LocLongDescription="By the book: one bolter shot at every visible enemy. Once per mission."
LocHelpText="Fire the bolter once at every visible enemy. Once per mission."
LocFlyOverText="Codex Volley"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Fire once at every visible enemy within bolter range.<br/><Bullet/> Ends the turn. Once per mission.<br/>"

[Astartes_PlasmaOvercharge X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Plasma Overcharge"
LocLongDescription="Run the coils hot. Heavy-weapon shots this turn deal +3 damage. 3-turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Heavy-weapon shots this turn deal +3 damage. Cooldown."
LocFlyOverText="Plasma Overcharge"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Free action: heavy-weapon shots for the rest of the turn deal +3 damage.<br/><Bullet/> 3-turn cooldown.<br/>"

[Astartes_LascannonRound X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Lascannon Round"
LocLongDescription="One shot, one hole. A heavy-weapon shot with +5 armour piercing and +2 damage. 2 charges per mission."
LocHelpText="Heavy shot: +5 pierce, +2 damage. 2 charges."
LocFlyOverText="Lascannon Round"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> A heavy-weapon shot that pierces 5 armour and deals +2 damage.<br/><Bullet/> 2 charges per mission.<br/>"

[Astartes_HeavyStance X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Heavy Stance"
LocLongDescription="From a set position the heavy weapon's first shot of the turn does not end it. Requires not having moved this turn."
LocHelpText="If unmoved, the first heavy-weapon shot each turn does not end the turn."
LocFlyOverText="Heavy Stance"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> If the Devastator has not moved this turn, his first standard shot does not end the turn.<br/>"

[Astartes_KrakMissile X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Krak Missile"
LocLongDescription="The anti-armour shot: +2 damage and +3 armour piercing. 3-turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Heavy shot: +2 damage, +3 pierce. Cooldown."
LocFlyOverText="Krak Missile"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> A heavy-weapon shot with +2 damage and +3 armour piercing.<br/><Bullet/> 3-turn cooldown.<br/>"

[Astartes_WeaponMount X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Weapon Mount"
LocLongDescription="Dug in behind the gun. While the Devastator has not moved this turn he gains +2 armour and +10 defence."
LocHelpText="Unmoved this turn: +2 armour, +10 defence."
LocFlyOverText="Weapon Mount"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> While the Devastator has not moved this turn: +2 armour and +10 defence.<br/>"

[Astartes_MeltaRound X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Melta Round"
LocLongDescription="Point blank, nothing stops it. A heavy shot at a target within 4 tiles that ignores armour and deals +3 damage. 2 charges per mission."
LocHelpText="Heavy shot within 4 tiles: ignores armour, +3 damage. 2 charges."
LocFlyOverText="Melta Round"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> A heavy-weapon shot at a target within 4 tiles.<br/><Bullet/> Ignores armour and deals +3 damage. 2 charges per mission.<br/>"

[Astartes_FieldSurgery X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Field Surgery"
LocLongDescription="A better-stocked narthecium: +1 heal charge per mission."
LocHelpText="+1 narthecium heal charge."
LocFlyOverText="Field Surgery"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> The narthecium carries one more heal per mission.<br/>"

[Astartes_ReductorMastery X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Reductor Mastery"
LocLongDescription="The Apothecary's skill with the reductor wastes nothing. Every geneseed recovery yields +1 geneseed."
LocHelpText="+1 geneseed per recovery."
LocFlyOverText="Reductor Mastery"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Recover Geneseed yields one extra geneseed.<br/>"

[Astartes_ChirurgeonsFury X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Chirurgeon's Fury"
LocLongDescription="Tending a brother sharpens the Apothecary's aim. After using the narthecium or a stimm this turn, his bolter hits are critical."
LocHelpText="After healing this turn, bolter hits crit."
LocFlyOverText="Chirurgeon's Fury"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> After a heal, stabilize, revive or stimm, the Apothecary's bolter hits for the rest of the turn are critical.<br/>"

[EnergyShield X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Telekine Shield"
LocLongDescription="A dome of force over the Librarian and the brothers beside him. Grants shield points that absorb damage. 4-turn cooldown. Psychic power: rolls for Perils."
LocHelpText="Shield points for the Librarian and nearby brothers. Cooldown."
LocFlyOverText="Telekine Shield"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> The Librarian and allies around him gain shield points that absorb damage.<br/><Bullet/> 4-turn cooldown. Rolls for Perils of the Warp.<br/>"

; --- Chapter Master capstones ---
[Astartes_DeathIncarnate X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Death Incarnate"
LocLongDescription="The Chapter Master becomes the storm. For the rest of this turn every melee kill refunds the action and readies the jump pack, with no limit. Free action, once per mission."
LocHelpText="This turn: every melee kill refunds the action and resets the jump pack. Once per mission."
LocFlyOverText="Death Incarnate"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Free action, once per mission.<br/><Bullet/> For the rest of the turn, every melee kill refunds the action spent and clears the jump pack cooldown.<br/><Bullet/> No cap: the slaughter lasts as long as the kills do.<br/>"

[Astartes_DeathIncarnate_Reset X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Death Incarnate"
LocLongDescription="While Death Incarnate is active, melee kills ready the jump pack."
LocHelpText="Melee kills ready the jump pack."
LocFlyOverText="Death Incarnate"

[Fuse X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Combustion"
LocLongDescription="The Librarian reaches into an enemy's ammunition and grenades and sets them off where they hang. Psychic power: rolls for Perils."
LocHelpText="Detonate a target's explosives. Rolls for Perils."
LocFlyOverText="Combustion"
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Detonates the explosives an enemy is carrying.<br/><Bullet/> Rolls for Perils of the Warp.<br/>"

[Astartes_JumpPackRig X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Jump Pack Rig"
LocLongDescription="The jump pack's harness and thrusters."
LocHelpText="Jump pack harness."
LocFlyOverText="Jump Pack Rig"
